<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealand shares end flat after RBNZ statement.</title>
<headline>New Zealand shares end flat after RBNZ statement.</headline>
<text>
<p>* New Zealand close flat in modest trading</p>
<p>* Telecom continues to fall</p>
<p>* RBNZ statement deflates market</p>
<p>---------------------------(Sept 13)---------------------------</p>
<p>Price movements at close</p>
<p>	    LAST CHG</p>
<p>  144  +1   * NZSE-40 cap index +1.67 at 2,213.90</p>
<p>  329  +4   * NZSC cap index +11.40 at 4,508.90</p>
<p>  276  +1   * NZSE-10 cap index +2.13 at 1,110.44</p>
<p>  359  +2   * Volume NZ$37.4 million. Futures +3 at 1,113</p>
<p>  678  -2   * Other movers - -15 +40</p>
